	(text "EXTINT is routed as an optional host signal for wake/time assistance. Final Apollo pin allocation may omit it if UART-RX wake is sufficient."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 171 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0c5b8df7-e3a7-4515-b30b-6d14e5b2fcf1")
	)
	(text "VOUT1_1V8 / VOUT2_3V0_PROVISIONAL and host/RF labels are local to this child sheet until the final hierarchy integration pass."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 196 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0f35b217-3162-4267-a67a-72f429e62d31")
	)
	(text "SDA/SCL and SAFEBOOT_N are NC because UART is the primary host interface. LNA_EN and VCC_RF are NC for the passive-antenna baseline."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 176 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "485c5e67-574a-4145-b3a2-60dd06e01dfd")
	)
	(text "Primary host link = UART at 1.8 V logic. Passive L1/L5 antenna is the Rev-A baseline; RF network is finished on 14_RF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a54f233-c9e3-4193-9bb5-75fda4b7d80e")
	)
	(text "If VCC/V_IO are ever hard-switched off, Apollo pins connected to MAX-F10S must be Hi-Z first; do not drive GNSS I/O while its supplies are absent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 151 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5f85f796-26da-4ba0-99b0-2106da7f24b9")
	)
	(text "The 1.8 V V_IO rail must meet u-blox ±2% accuracy. VCC supply path must support up to 100 mA startup inrush and must not add >0.2 ohm series resistance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ab202a7-c723-4a7d-9ea7-38a050c98fc7")
	)
	(text "MAX-F10S integrates L1/L5 SAW filtering + LNA + diplexer SAW, so do not duplicate an external SAW/LNA stage without a measured RF reason."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 186 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7318f7ef-6161-4354-b9b4-7e484a8813a6")
	)
	(text "RESET_N is intentionally NC. u-blox recommends leaving it open for normal operation; do not add a capacitor to RESET_N. Reset also clears BBR/RTC/orbit data."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 161 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "75e58b48-fd0a-4ec7-bc87-df8788822588")
	)
	(text "RF_IN -> GNSS_RF. Route as controlled 50 ohm; RF_IN already contains a DC block. Keep this trace extremely short and away from display/Wi-Fi/high-speed clocks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 181 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7f6a4d58-3b6a-4004-9e1f-79eeb1f00a95")
	)
	(text "POWER: VCC = VOUT2_3V0_PROVISIONAL (~3.0 V); V_IO = VOUT1_1V8; VIO_SEL = GND selects the 1.8 V I/O range."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 136 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9ed343a4-4861-42e6-b1c0-2b14636f9214")
	)
	(text "TIMEPULSE is routed to GNSS_TIMEPULSE. Never load/pull it low during receiver startup because it is internally linked to SAFEBOOT_N."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 166 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a644dc77-0708-422b-a12b-2fa3004e9e55")
	)
	(text "05_GNSS — u-blox MAX-F10S-00B DUAL-BAND GNSS — REV A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ae3e84c3-be9a-4ab6-b168-6665bb960be0")
	)
	(text "POWER MANAGEMENT: prefer MAX-F10S software-standby when GNSS is idle. VCC and V_IO remain supplied, so host PIO isolation buffers are not required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 146 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd3ab2e7-aec2-4e05-a0e0-5c78ebdcd9cb")
	)
	(text "Footprint field MAX-F10S_UBL is retained from the imported symbol; verify module pad geometry, pin-1 orientation and courtyard during the footprint audit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24 191 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.92 0.92)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "da9f4f03-4e2c-4ee3-ba87-3e690379f01d")
	)
	(text "V_BCKP is intentionally NC in Rev A. Host time/orbit assistance can be used instead; add a backup rail later only if TTFF measurements justify it."
